{"seq":2,"slug":"volume-calculation","title":"五年级数学 — 体积计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/mathematics/space-geometry/volume-calculation","wordCount":1467,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"五年级数学-体积计算\">五年级数学 — 体积计算</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>体积是指物体所占空间的大小。我们已经认识了长方体和正方体，现在来学习如何计算它们的体积。掌握体积计算，可以帮助我们解决很多实际问题，比如计算水箱能装多少水、搬家时需要多大的箱子等。</p>\n<p>体积的常用单位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>大小参照</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立方厘米</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一个小骰子的大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立方分米</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一个粉笔盒的大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立方米</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一个大衣柜的大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单位换算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1000<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1000<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>1L（升）= 1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1000mL（毫升）</li>\n<li>1mL = 1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-体积的概念\">一、体积的概念</h3><p>体积和面积不同：面积衡量的是平面的大小（二维），体积衡量的是空间的大小（三维）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>一维</td>\n<td>米、厘米</td>\n<td>绳子有多长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积</td>\n<td>二维</td>\n<td>平方米、平方厘米</td>\n<td>桌面有多大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>三维</td>\n<td>立方米、立方厘米</td>\n<td>箱子能装多少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-长方体的体积\">二、长方体的体积</h3><p><strong>体积公式</strong>：V = 长 × 宽 × 高 = a × b × h</p>\n<p><strong>推导过程</strong>：用1立方厘米的小正方体来填满一个长方体。</p>\n<p>假设长方体长4cm、宽3cm、高2cm：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>底面一行可以摆4个小正方体</li>\n<li>底面可以摆3行，共4 × 3 = 12个</li>\n<li>可以摆2层，共12 × 2 = 24个</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以体积 = 4 × 3 × 2 = 24(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)</p>\n<p><strong>例题1</strong>：一个长方体的长是8cm，宽是5cm，高是6cm，求体积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"V = a × b × h&#10;  = 8 × 5 × 6&#10;  = 240(cm^3)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>V = a × b × h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = 8 × 5 × 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = 240(cm^3)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三-正方体的体积\">三、正方体的体积</h3><p>正方体是长、宽、高都相等的长方体，所以：</p>\n<p><strong>体积公式</strong>：V = 棱长 × 棱长 × 棱长 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>例题2</strong>：一个正方体的棱长是5cm，求体积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"V = a^3 = 5^3 = 5 × 5 × 5 = 125(cm^3)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>V = a^3 = 5^3 = 5 × 5 × 5 = 125(cm^3)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"四-体积的统一公式\">四、体积的统一公式</h3><p>无论是长方体还是正方体，体积都可以用一个统一公式来计算：</p>\n<p><strong>V = 底面积 × 高 = S底 × h</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图形</th>\n<th>底面积S底</th>\n<th>体积公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长方体</td>\n<td>长 × 宽 = a × b</td>\n<td>V = a × b × h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正方体</td>\n<td>棱长 × 棱长 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>V = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> × h = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个公式非常重要，将来学习圆柱体积时也会用到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-容积\">五、容积</h3><p>容积是容器内部空间的大小。容积和体积的区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>体积</th>\n<th>容积</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测量对象</td>\n<td>物体占据的空间</td>\n<td>容器内部能装的东西</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包含范围</td>\n<td>包括外壳厚度</td>\n<td>不包括外壳厚度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算方法</td>\n<td>用外部尺寸</td>\n<td>用内部尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>例题3</strong>：一个长方体水箱，外部尺寸为长50cm、宽30cm、高40cm，箱壁厚度为1cm。求水箱的容积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"内部尺寸：&#10;  长 = 50 - 2×1 = 48(cm)&#10;  宽 = 30 - 2×1 = 28(cm)&#10;  高 = 40 - 1 = 39(cm)    （底部有壁，顶部开口）&#10;&#10;容积 = 48 × 28 × 39 = 52416(cm^3) = 52.416(dm^3) = 52.416(L)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>内部尺寸：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  长 = 50 - 2×1 = 48(cm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  宽 = 30 - 2×1 = 28(cm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  高 = 40 - 1 = 39(cm)    （底部有壁，顶部开口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>容积 = 48 × 28 × 39 = 52416(cm^3) = 52.416(dm^3) = 52.416(L)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"六-体积单位换算\">六、体积单位换算</h3><p>掌握相邻两个体积单位之间的进率是1000。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1m^3 = 1000dm^3&#10;1dm^3 = 1000cm^3&#10;1m^3 = 1000000cm^3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1m^3 = 1000dm^3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1dm^3 = 1000cm^3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1m^3 = 1000000cm^3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>换算方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大单位→小单位：乘以1000</li>\n<li>小单位→大单位：除以1000</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>换算</th>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3.5<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = ___<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3.5 × 1000</td>\n<td>3500<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2400<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = ___<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2400 ÷ 1000</td>\n<td>2.4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.2L = ___mL</td>\n<td>5.2 × 1000</td>\n<td>5200mL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"七-不规则物体的体积\">七、不规则物体的体积</h3><p>测量不规则物体（如石块）的体积，可以用&quot;排水法&quot;：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在量杯中装适量的水，记录水面高度</li>\n<li>将物体放入水中，记录此时的水面高度</li>\n<li>物体体积 = 放入后水面高度对应的体积 - 放入前水面高度对应的体积</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><p><strong>练习一：基础计算</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>长方体：长10cm，宽7cm，高4cm，V = ___</li>\n<li>正方体：棱长9cm，V = ___</li>\n<li>把5.6<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>换算成<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>dm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：___</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>练习二：应用题</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>一个长方体游泳池，长25m，宽10m，深2m。注满水需要多少立方米的水？相当于多少升？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一块正方体的冰，棱长为20cm。这块冰融化后变成水，水的体积大约是多少？（冰融化为水后体积约缩小十分之一）</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>练习三：综合题</strong></p>\n<p>将一个棱长为6cm的正方体木块切成两个完全相同的长方体。求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个小长方体的体积</li>\n<li>两个小长方体的表面积之和比原来正方体的表面积增加了多少？</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>思考题：</strong></p>\n<p>有一个长方体容器，底面是边长10cm的正方形，高20cm。向容器中放入一个棱长5cm的正方体铁块后，往容器里倒满水。把铁块取出后，容器中水面下降了多少厘米？</p>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>体积计算在生活中应用广泛。建筑工程师需要计算混凝土的体积来确定用量，快递公司用体积重量来决定运费，甚至烘焙蛋糕时也要根据模具的体积来调整配方。</p>\n<p>有趣的体积比较：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个乒乓球的体积约33<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>一个足球的体积约5500<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>国际空间站的可用体积约916<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，相当于一栋三层小楼</li>\n</ul>\n<p>古希腊数学家阿基米德发现了&quot;排水法&quot;来测量不规则物体的体积，据说他在洗澡时灵感迸发，激动得跑上街头大喊&quot;尤里卡！&quot;（我找到了！）</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节课我们学习了体积的概念和计算方法。长方体体积 = 长 × 宽 × 高，正方体体积 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>棱长</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{棱长}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">棱长</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，统一公式为 V = 底面积 × 高。同时我们还学习了容积的概念、体积单位换算和不规则物体的测量方法。体积计算是空间几何的基础，为将来学习更复杂的立体图形打下坚实的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-内相关条目\">本 hub 内相关条目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"3d-shapes\">立体图形认识</a>：本篇练习三要回答&quot;切割后表面积增加多少&quot;，需要回到长方体和正方体的面、棱特征与表面积公式；体积与表面积成对出现，建议放在一起复习。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"五年级数学 — 体积计算","id":"五年级数学-体积计算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、体积的概念","id":"一-体积的概念"},{"level":3,"text":"二、长方体的体积","id":"二-长方体的体积"},{"level":3,"text":"三、正方体的体积","id":"三-正方体的体积"},{"level":3,"text":"四、体积的统一公式","id":"四-体积的统一公式"},{"level":3,"text":"五、容积","id":"五-容积"},{"level":3,"text":"六、体积单位换算","id":"六-体积单位换算"},{"level":3,"text":"七、不规则物体的体积","id":"七-不规则物体的体积"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本 hub 内相关条目","id":"本-hub-内相关条目"}],"prev":{"title":"五年级数学 — 立体图形认识","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/mathematics/space-geometry/3d-shapes"},"next":{"title":"五年级数学 — 坐标初步","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/mathematics/space-geometry/coordinate-intro"}}